    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Change Request Filtering Workflow\nDescription: Steps to open the filter panel and add sequential AND conditions for Change Request lists.\n- Navigate to the Change Request List page (URL contains change_request_list.do).\n- Click the 'Show / hide filter' button (bid a47) to reveal the filter inputs.\n- Click the field chooser combobox (e.g., a1181) to select the first condition field.\n- Select the desired field from the dropdown (e.g., 'Type', 'Requested by', 'Model').\n- Click the value chooser combobox (e.g., a1639) to set the operator and value for the selected field.\n- Use 'select_option' or click the specific option (e.g., 'Normal', 'System Administrator') to set the value.\n- Click the 'Add AND Condition' button (e.g., a1303) to append the next condition to the current chain.\n- Repeat the field selection, value setting, and 'Add AND Condition' steps for all required criteria."
