    "input_texts": [
      "Title: ServiceNow Filter Panel Interaction Patterns\nDescription: Key UI signals and potential failure points when building complex AND filters.\n- The filter panel is controlled by the 'Show / hide filter' button which toggles the 'change_requestfilterdiv'.\n- Field choosers are comboboxes with 'hasPopup=listbox' that require a click to open the field list.\n- Value choosers are comboboxes with 'hasPopup=menu' that appear after a field is selected.\n- Direct clicking on visible options in value choosers may fail if the element is not clickable; using 'select_option' on the combobox bid is more reliable.\n- The 'Add AND Condition' button text dynamically updates to show the full condition (e.g., 'Type is Normal').\n- The field chooser for new conditions always shows 'All of these conditions must be met. -- choose field --'.\n- Empty string conditions require selecting the 'is empty string' option from the operator combobox.\n- The workflow assumes an 'AND' logic group ('All of these conditions must be met') is the active context."
    ],
